### Todos los clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes

### Obtener a un cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes/3

### Crear un cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Jorge Luis",
    "apellido": "Mamani Quispe",
    "telefono": "129864235",
    "ci": "8948359 LP",
    "licencia": "LIC-3421"
}

### Modificar un cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/clientes/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Roberto C",
    "apellido": "Mamani Q",
    "telefono": "123876",
    "ci": "14415003 LP",
    "licencia": "LIC-1321"   
}

### Eliminar un cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/clientes/3

